Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:04.48,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Oda's troops have invaded Hiei Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:08.73,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Her main force is striking from Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:12.44,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Kawajiri Hidetaka and Nakagawa Shigemasa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.44,0:00:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,are attacking from Yokogawa with 1500 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:19.33,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,The Mino Three are striking Tanotani Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:25.32,Default,Y,0,0,0,,She fell for my plan so easily.\NIt's almost no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:28.71,Default,Guy2,0,0,0,,Why did you entrust luring\NNobuna to Hiei Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and capturing her to Tsuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.85,0:00:33.17,Default,K,0,0,0,,We don't need him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:37.23,Default,K,0,0,0,,It's his punishment for ignoring \Nme during the Imagawa debacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:40.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But Oda's forces are unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:41.50,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.18,Default,Shoukakuin,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:48.55,Default,Shoukakuin,0,0,0,,The Hiei Mountain territory includes\Nlarge mountains and 1500 temples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a natural fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.37,Default,Y,0,0,0,,And you have my armies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and the many provisions and\Ngunpowder Tsuda brought in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.39,0:00:58.20,Default,Y,0,0,0,,We're ready for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.95,Default,K,0,0,0,,This mountain will be Nobuna's grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:47.12,Default,Y,0,0,0,,They're like moths to a flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:52.33,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Capture Oda's female generals alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.61,Default,Nk,0,0,0,,It'll be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:58.11,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Just do what you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.25,Default,Y,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,do {\i1}not{\i0} kill Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:08.44,Default,D,0,0,0,,At this rate, there will\Nonly be more casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.94,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,We cannot leave the princess alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:13.50,Default,D,0,0,0,,Let us set fire to the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:18.78,Default,D,0,0,0,,If this mountain is a fortress,\Nwe can just burn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.17,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:26.78,Default,D,0,0,0,,Even if it turns every priest and\Nbeliever against us, we should torch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.18,Default,D,0,0,0,,If she wants to unite Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,she needs to be capable of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:35.02,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Only a demon could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:40.15,Default,D,0,0,0,,It would take a demon to end these wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.91,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,I won't let you make her one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:47.46,Default,H,0,0,0,,So, all of that happened while I slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.16,0:03:50.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,I have failed as a tactician.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:55.15,Default,MerchantGuy,0,0,0,,If we attack Eizan, we'll lose the people's trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.46,Default,MerchantGuy,0,0,0,,Then it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.48,Default,I,0,0,0,,If only Yoshiharu were here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.14,Default,Lois,0,0,0,,You mustn't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:08.51,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:13.02,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,We have to stop her, or Brother would be sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:17.72,Default,I,0,0,0,,But nobody can get through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.86,Default,I,0,0,0,,She must have suffered greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.49,0:04:22.56,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Do {\i1}you{\i0} have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:27.21,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,The only one who can stop \Nthe princess is you, Hanbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:34.16,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoshiharu is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:43.88,Default,A,0,0,0,,If you think that'd be enough to kill me, you're mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.10,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mijingakure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.57,0:04:56.27,Default,A,0,0,0,,A ninja technique where a real bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:04:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,is replaced with a smoke \Nbomb, and in the smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the target hides in a hole dug beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:03.24,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mr. Hanzou {\i1}saved{\i0} him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.66,Default,I,0,0,0,,But... he was blown apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.70,Default,H,0,0,0,,Zenki took his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:16.99,Default,H,0,0,0,,Right now, there's no way for me\Nto summon Zenki to confirm it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:19.04,Default,H,0,0,0,,but I know I'm not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.98,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Then Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:28.14,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoshiharu wouldn't die and\Nleave such a cute little sister behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.60,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:33.28,Default,I,0,0,0,,He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:43.86,Default,M,0,0,0,,We should've dug him out earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:46.15,Default,Hanzou,0,0,0,,It's your fault, Motoyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.36,0:05:52.99,Default,Hanzou,0,0,0,,If you hadn't come back,\NI'd have dug him out long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:59.30,Default,Hanzou,0,0,0,,Protecting my master is \Nmy highest priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:03.18,Default,M,0,0,0,,Sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:07.36,Default,Han,0,0,0,,After he dug himself out, \Nhe probably headed for Kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:12.45,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mister Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:18.42,Default,A,0,0,0,,If you died without asking me first, I'd kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:30.99,Default,A,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:34.85,Default,K,0,0,0,,Where's the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.20,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:37.46,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,We must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:40.92,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,This isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.96,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:01.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:06.65,Default,A,0,0,0,,Call my name, not hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.73,Default,A,0,0,0,,Now, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:11.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,I-I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.91,Default,A,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:20.28,Default,A,0,0,0,,Why are you so cold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:21.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,So cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.67,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:29.13,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\i1}The fire isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:40.64,Default,A,0,0,0,,This makes us even for Kiyomizu Temple!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.75,0:07:50.32,Default,A,0,0,0,,I won't let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want you to end up like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to stay the girl who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}spins a globe while talking about\Nher dreams for the world!{The line in ep. 2 was "I want you to stay the girl who spins\Na globe and talks about her dreams!" but CR's script for this ep was "spinning her globe and dreaming \Nabout the whole wide world!". I went for something in-between. -GBF}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:13.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I see that you're going to lose sight of your own path,{Another quote from ep. 2. CR's lines here(preserved above) feel more accurate than what they used there but they're close enough that I think consistency wins out. -GBF}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:16.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.99,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.19,0:08:33.82,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:37.28,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna set fire to the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:39.77,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,The burning of Hiei Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:44.98,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,{\q3}Generations to come will call the perpetrator one of history's greatest fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.17,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Now Nobuna has turned all Japan against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:52.89,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:09:00.60,Default,Kono,0,0,0,,Eizan will be my fortress \Nfor conquering Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.35,Default,Y,0,0,0,,{\i1}That slime...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.91,Default,Mino,0,0,0,,They set fire to their own base?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:09.86,Default,Mino,0,0,0,,Haven't we seen this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.19,Default,Mino,0,0,0,,You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.77,0:09:18.06,Default,Kono,0,0,0,,Make sure you kill Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.55,0:09:30.09,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey, this is what you're\Ntrying to tell me, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:35.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's wrong to fight for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:39.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're always like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:43.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,speaking like you know it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:53.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,I have to make a world where this\Nwill never happen again, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.67,Default,N,0,0,0,,And for that, I have to defeat Konoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:03.13,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey, lend me your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:11.08,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Nagahide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:13.84,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,All forces retreat from Hiei Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.71,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Danjo, take command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:17.01,Default,D,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.42,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,I'll follow the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.59,0:10:23.89,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'll leave command of the \Nsoldiers to Inaba here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:30.15,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm going to see where Lord Nobuna ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.10,Default,K,0,0,0,,You'd better run or you'll get roasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.56,Default,Miniboss Girls,0,0,0,,You can't be a general...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:38.61,Default,Miniboss Girls,0,0,0,,...if something like this scares you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:41.07,Default,K,0,0,0,,Splendid, my foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.96,0:10:42.66,Default,K,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.73,0:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.60,0:10:53.34,Default,Miniboss,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:06.86,Default,Miniboss,0,0,0,,Take them and leave the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.80,Default,Y,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:16.58,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We were so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:21.03,Default,Y,0,0,0,,If Nobuna is as good as I think she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.03,0:11:24.16,Default,Y,0,0,0,,we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.18,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,The time is finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.71,Default,N,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.10,0:11:42.14,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,You're going to tell me why he chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.70,0:11:52.48,Default,I,0,0,0,,Tsuda?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.82,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I found him running from the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.86,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,I-It was all Konoe's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:03.74,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,{\i1}He{\i0} set fire to the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.88,0:12:06.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,What about Lord Nobuna and her generals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.46,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.19,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hanbei?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:16.54,Default,H,0,0,0,,Our priority now is putting out the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:21.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr. Yoshiharu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.97,Default,M,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see the Viper here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.97,0:12:27.90,Default,M,0,0,0,,What about your province?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:31.18,Default,D,0,0,0,,Mino is far less important than the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:33.28,Default,G,0,0,0,,You think well of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:36.31,Default,D,0,0,0,,Someday, he's going to marry my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.57,Default,D,0,0,0,,I need to bring him back to my Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:43.95,Default,G,0,0,0,,That's why we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:51.66,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Brother is such a lucky man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:56.55,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,Most likely, he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.78,Default,G,0,0,0,,...hiding somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:09.21,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,You took everything from me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.23,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,and {\i1}this{\i0} is the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:16.84,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,The monkey and Mitsuhide died for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:18.36,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,They died for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:22.65,Default,N,0,0,0,,They didn't die for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:26.03,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey is still with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.65,0:13:29.56,Default,N,0,0,0,,His dreams, Juubei's dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,are alive within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:35.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,Uniting Japan isn't just my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,A world where dreams are passed on...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:42.09,Default,N,0,0,0,,creating that world is the duty of the one who unites Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.59,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,Now I understand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:49.59,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,why he chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:51.85,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,But that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.59,0:13:54.39,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,I must surpass you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.68,0:14:00.58,Default,K,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.82,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,You came through the flames?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:06.20,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If that's where the princess is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:09.34,Default,D,0,0,0,,We're all a bunch of fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:12.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,But that's what makes the Oda Clan great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.95,Default,K,0,0,0,,Now, you fight {\i1}us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.88,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,Konoe is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.46,Default,N,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.44,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.14,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,Can she kill Konoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:38.94,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,This is a trial to see if \Nshe is worthy of her goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.56,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Then we need not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:44.22,Default,K,0,0,0,,She's our princess, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.94,0:14:52.30,Default,Merchant,0,0,0,,We managed to get all these \Nthanks to the power of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:55.82,Default,I,0,0,0,,Now it's all down to Hanbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:09.54,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,Konoe... did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:15.25,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,The ruler of Japan should be one who is chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,one of noble birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.47,0:15:23.81,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,It is absurd for an insignificant\Ncountry girl to seek the title.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:29.07,Default,N,0,0,0,,This country is in chaos because of people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:30.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,Who cares about nobility?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:35.31,Default,N,0,0,0,,Obsessing over that is why people can't be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:38.48,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:41.43,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,The high-born rule over the low-born!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.43,0:15:44.83,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,That is the custom of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.83,0:15:47.59,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then I'll wipe out that custom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.10,0:15:50.47,Default,N,0,0,0,,The path we follow and the people we love...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:53.55,Default,N,0,0,0,,We're the ones who get \Nto decide our own futures!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:56.89,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:06.76,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,The one who decides
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,the future of the people of this country...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.33,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,will be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.74,0:16:18.26,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.69,0:16:23.85,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:36.60,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:41.10,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,The feelings that people have \Nwill change the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:47.03,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Begone, Konoe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:05.37,Default,Ko,0,0,0,,Curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,Thank you, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:21.49,Default,N,0,0,0,,You saved me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:27.23,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:29.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,It looks like this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:37.98,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, it's the Oda Clan's \Nturn to carry on my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:43.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someday, they'll reach the future you lived in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll see each other again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:51.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,Is this... another dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:03.89,Default,N,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.89,0:18:06.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's a \Ndream or the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.48,0:18:08.98,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.31,0:18:15.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,I've come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.44,Default,N,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.44,0:18:19.54,Default,N,0,0,0,,Doofus! Twit! Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.54,Default,N,0,0,0,,How could you die and leave me behind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.20,0:18:24.49,Default,S,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:28.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,You promised you'd stay with \Nme until my dream came true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:30.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:31.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,I said I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:34.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:36.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,Stay with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.80,0:18:38.03,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,I got it, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:43.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,Anyway, I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's time for you to fulfill your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:45.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,My promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oh, right, the kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:50.75,Default,N,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:53.11,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is a dream anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:57.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:08.68,Default,D,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:09.66,Default,I,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:13.78,Default,M,0,0,0,,Your first kiss tastes like honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.85,0:19:21.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:23.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}does{\i0} hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.34,0:19:24.38,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:25.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,Of course it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.60,0:19:31.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,A kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.42,Default,N,0,0,0,,You're terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:34.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,That was the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.86,Default,N,0,0,0,,I can't do that in front of other people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.86,0:19:38.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,You stupid monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:39.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,You perverted monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:40.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,Cut it ou—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:46.34,Default,N,0,0,0,,You really are... a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:50.77,Default,N,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:15.38,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,Y-You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:18.06,Default,L,0,0,0,,Let me pray, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.19,Default,Shou,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.73,0:20:24.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Gods of water, hear my prayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:51.65,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,The fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.60,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:56.35,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,That's my sister for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.25,0:20:59.36,Default,Ma,0,0,0,,It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.05,Default,K,0,0,0,,It's just like we said, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:03.86,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The princess won.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:06.20,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,120 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:11.71,Default,K,0,0,0,,I'll see you on the battlefield again someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.22,0:21:16.71,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,So, the heavens chose Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:20.38,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,A dream isn't something that \Nbelongs to just one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:23.50,Default,Empress,0,0,0,,Take good care of Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,That must be Hanbei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.21,0:21:29.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,I hope she doesn't collapse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:51.33,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The greatest danger that Nobuna \Nhad ever faced was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.67,0:21:54.83,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,However, the civil wars continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:22:00.84,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,A long and difficult journey still\Nremains on the path to uniting Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.91,0:22:06.84,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Nobuna! Nobuna! Nobuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:13.08,Default,K,0,0,0,,She told the Asakura that if they \Nwanted to leave, they could?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.08,0:22:14.83,Default,K,0,0,0,,The princess is too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:16.53,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,That's what I like about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.53,0:22:18.02,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,100 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:21.36,Default,K,0,0,0,,Well, we can always fight them next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:23.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,I was worried for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.92,Default,G,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.92,0:22:27.97,Default,G,0,0,0,,Sagara is very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.97,0:22:29.66,Default,G,0,0,0,,And fwom now won I'll pwotect—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:31.93,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,She's biting her tongue again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.12,Default,G,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:36.70,Default,Do,0,0,0,,I'm glad she forgave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:37.58,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:41.68,Default,Do,0,0,0,,I hope this will teach you \Nnot to play any more tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:44.13,Default,D,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm hearing \Nthat from the Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:47.06,Default,D,0,0,0,,You've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:50.74,Default,I,0,0,0,,The princess and Yoshiharu are too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.34,Default,M,0,0,0,,They are close, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.34,0:22:53.14,Default,A,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.14,0:22:56.09,Default,A,0,0,0,,She's not nearly as close to him as {\i1}I've{\i0} been.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:58.23,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Something happened with Brother, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.61,0:23:00.98,Default,A,0,0,0,,Nothing happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:04.02,Default,N,0,0,0,,Asai. Asakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:05.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,Uesugi. Takeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:09.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,There are still many enemies standing in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.64,0:23:11.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.57,0:23:13.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hey, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.59,0:23:16.24,Default,N,0,0,0,,Make that promise once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:19.25,Default,N,0,0,0,,Until my dream comes true...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.25,0:23:21.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.92,0:23:24.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wherever you go, I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.67,0:23:29.51,Default,N,0,0,0,,Let's go, Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.51,0:23:31.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.67,0:23:34.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,Come unite Japan with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:29.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}tada jidai no mannaka tatasarete tomadou toki ni
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:40.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}te wo hiite kureta hito e dekiru koto sagashita
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:45.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}kizutsuki nagara warau sugata
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:49.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}kokoro no ura namida ga mieta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:55.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}sukui motomeru koe kikitoreru no wa
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:21:01.54,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}yurusareta mono dake
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:06.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}kazoe kirenu arashi wo koete
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:12.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}anata no yami saku hikari ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:17.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}mou mayowanai tomo ni ikitai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:22.14,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}chikau yume ga donna mubou de atte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:32.57,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}oboeteite shinjirareru basho wa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:36.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}koko ni aru to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:29.80,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}When I, lost in time, was standing there confused
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:40.02,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}You pulled me through, so I wanted to do something in return
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:45.23,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}You were smiling even though you were being hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:49.82,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}I saw you shedding tears deep inside
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.82,0:20:55.32,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}I could only understand your call for help
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.32,0:21:01.54,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}When you opened up to me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:06.67,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}I will overcome the countless storms
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:12.05,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}And become the light that cuts through your darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:17.10,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}I won't hesitate anymore; let's go together
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.10,0:21:22.14,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}No matter how unrealistic our ambitions are
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:32.57,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}Remember there's a place you can believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:36.74,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(200,500)}Right here
